# Who may read and write what (docs/protocolo.md §1). Topics: idoso/<site>/<quarto>/...

# Room hubs (and the simulator, which plays one): publish everything of a room,
# read their configuration.
user hub
topic write idoso/#
topic read idoso/+/+/config/desejada

# Wearables with the optional MQTT link (firmware GADGET_MQTT): their own telemetry and
# link status, and the fall alert when the hub does not answer. Not pulseira/<id> itself,
# which is the hub's view of the wearable.
user pulseira
topic write idoso/+/+/pulseira/+/telemetria
topic write idoso/+/+/pulseira/+/mqtt
topic write idoso/+/+/alerta

# History: reads everything.
user telegraf
topic read idoso/#

# Telegram notifications: only the alerts.
user notificador
topic read idoso/+/+/alerta

# People and tools: read everything, change the rule parameters of a room.
user painel
topic read idoso/#
topic write idoso/+/+/config/desejada
